{
  "about": "Golden cancellation-rights scenarios (BUILD-PLAN Phase 2 exit gate; SM§6.2, R§12.1-12.1a). 'tx' evaluates the seeded Texas pack v2 (federal + ch. 601); 'federal' the seeded federal pack. Amounts are cents as strings; times are UTC.",
